<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n0\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">In the distance, the goshinboku of Central Park came into view.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Naturally, at an hour like this, not even a police officer was in sight.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Pouring down from the goshinboku, a storm of cherry petals―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">This is what </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> says she hates.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s dream, apparently, had blood pouring down from the cherry blossoms.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Could it be that </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, when </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1">'s father died, saw that sight with her own eyes?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In that case, it's also conceivable that cherry blossoms became a trauma for her.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Since they had come for hanami as a family, wouldn't </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1"> have seen it too?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But, it's better not to bring that up right now.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Since </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1">'s feelings have finally settled, I should talk about something else.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="3">... I'm the one who suggested going to </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s place, so it's strange for me to say this, but..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hm?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Um... the Kogori family is surely going to be busy from now on, aren't they... with preparations for the funeral and all."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Ahh... true enough..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">With the murder and </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1">'s curse business, it had slipped my mind, but </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Senpai's father</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s funeral might start as soon as tomorrow.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That being the case, wouldn't we be in the way? That was what I had belatedly started to think.</STYLE><PG>
"If that's the case, let's help with the preparations too. We have to go to the funeral either way, right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, her best friend, was going through a hard time, but it's exactly at times like that that we have to be the ones supporting her.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That, of course, was how I felt too.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hmm, I should have brought my uniform from home. If you're a student, a school uniform is fine for a funeral, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "2000" "PASS"}
"Huh...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1"> gave me a puzzled look.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "強風.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "500" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\自転車ブレーキ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\公園夜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
"What're you talking about, <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE>? For a funeral, it's a Noh mask and red robes, right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">A Noh mask? Red robes?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I had never been to anyone's funeral, but I had thought people normally wore black clothes, or their school uniforms if they were students, though.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Even so, I had never heard of anything like a Noh mask.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Was it some religious thing of the Niimura family's?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If so, it wasn't something for me to butt in on, though.</STYLE>
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "29" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"All right, I'll try calling <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE>."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき電話.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Senpai stopped her bike and put her phone to her ear.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Hearing about the Niimura-way funeral had struck me as strange, but, well, that didn't matter right now.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> needed support, and that was what I should be putting my head to.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">But, what is it, this sense that something's off?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">This isn't about the Niimura-way funeral, but about the murder this time.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I'm overlooking something. Something important.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">For a moment I was seized by that unease, but right now I have to get the two of them together, quickly.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And if we can all greet the morning together, there will be nothing left to worry about.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Still, the wind had suddenly picked up.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Even though there had been no wind all day today...</STYLE><PG>
"That's weird... She's not picking up."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">Not picking up? Surely not...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> being who she is, she should be waiting near the phone.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\自転車止める.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\マンション前夜.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">We parked our bikes in front of the apartment building.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> was calling back again and again.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エレベーター前.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき電話.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Why...! Why aren't you picking up...!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\スイッチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\スイッチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\スイッチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\スイッチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\スイッチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1"> was mashing the elevator button while shouting into a phone nobody was answering.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The elevator was moving slowly and would not come down.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\アスファルトダッシュ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "3000" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Then, </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> broke into a run toward the stairs.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="3">, wait!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\階段速上り.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\マンション階段.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> pulled farther and farther ahead of me as I chased after her.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hah! Hah!"</STYLE>
{STOPSND "VOICE" "2000" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Gasping for breath, I reached the floor of </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s apartment.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\外廊下夜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Wait for me...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> was just then opening </STYLE>
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "500" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s front door.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It seemed the door had been unlocked, and </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> ran inside the apartment.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\アスファルトダッシュ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">I followed her too, thrust my hand into the gap of the door as it was swinging shut, and threw it open in one go.</STYLE>
{STOPSND "SE" "2000" "PASS"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">There was no sense of anyone inside; it was dead silent.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I went into the apartment with my shoes still on and headed toward the living room.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\居間.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">What was there was the Kogori family's living room, the same as always.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPD TIME="4294967096">Is what I'd have called it, but the sight was far too removed from that.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "death_sound1.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\古郡家居間死体.gal" "NORMAL" "11" "7000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPN>Is hell a sight like this?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Blood had spread across the floor, and a great amount of blood had splattered on the walls too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Lying collapsed, a great amount of blood flowing from her head, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai's mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Her abdomen pierced by countless knives, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai's mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Only her head lying off somewhere apart from her body, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "700" "1000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\能面フラッシュ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Beside them, a bloodstained </STYLE><STYLE ID="7" RUBY="なた">nata</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and a Noh mask had been set down.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">A Noh mask... what </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1"> was talking about a little while ago, that...</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\haa1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
"Hah... hah..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">From the direction of the kitchen, I heard ragged breathing.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\台所1.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">When I turned around, </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1">, right there―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Beside her was what </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1"> must have brought up: a puddle of </STYLE><STYLE ID="8" RUBY="としゃぶつ">vomit</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花覗き込み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Hey, look, <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE>... Are you still going to say there's no curse, even with this?
{PAUSE ""}
　Hahaha... Amazing, it's amazing! Me, I'm a witch, right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> didn't even wipe away the </STYLE><STYLE ID="8" RUBY="としゃぶつ">vomit</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> dripping from her mouth, and spoke as if holding back laughter.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"N-</STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="3">... that's wrong... this isn't some curse..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But my voice was shaking, and I couldn't stay calm enough to talk sense into </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> slowly walked over to </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s head.</STYLE>
