{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE>... <STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE>'re still warm... If I'd gotten here a little sooner, would I have been able to save you...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Half-open eyes, and a mouth hanging wide open now that the muscles of the </STYLE><STYLE ID="9" RUBY="けいぶ">neck</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> were gone.</STYLE>
